     The lliibb8800221111 library is an interface to the net80211(4) infrastructure.
     It implements wrappers around the net80211(4) ioctl command, as well as
     providing a convenient API to access the regulatory database.

     The lliibb8800221111__aalllloocc__rreeggddaattaa() and lliibb8800221111__ffrreeee__rreeggddaattaa() function allo‐
     cates / frees a regdata structure to store regulatory domain information
     in.

     The lliibb8800221111__rreeggddoommaaiinn__rreeaaddccoonnffiigg() and lliibb8800221111__rreeggddoommaaiinn__cclleeaannuupp()
     functions read in the regulatory database XML configuration and free it
     when finished.

     The lliibb8800221111__rreeggddoommaaiinn__ffiinnddbbyysskkuu() and lliibb8800221111__rreeggddoommaaiinn__ffiinnddbbyynnaammee()
     functions look up a regulatory domain entry by SKU enum and SKU name re‐
     spectively.

     The lliibb8800221111__ccoouunnttrryy__ffiinnddbbyycccc() and lliibb8800221111__ccoouunnttrryy__ffiinnddbbyynnaammee() func‐
     tions look up a country information entry by ISO country enum and ISO
     country code string respectively.

